# Physical scheelite BaWO4 model. Heavy-atom topology and oxygen site are
# based on the I41/a scheelite family; the fully occupied oxygen coordinate
# replaces the split, half-occupied oxygen model in COD 1527204.
data_BaWO4_scheelite
_chemical_formula_sum                 'Ba W O4'
_chemical_formula_structural          BaWO4
_cell_length_a                        5.614000
_cell_length_b                        5.614000
_cell_length_c                        12.719000
_cell_angle_alpha                     90
_cell_angle_beta                      90
_cell_angle_gamma                     90
_cell_formula_units_Z                 4
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M        'I 41/a'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number           88
loop_
 _symmetry_equiv_pos_site_id
 _symmetry_equiv_pos_as_xyz
